      "message": "I think Arve explained it well here https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/kernel/common/+/3605132/comment/56db00f0_c08dd258/\n\nIn essence, when the hypervisor returns the negotiated version (1.b), the host can rely on the compatibility rules to use any prior version (1.y) as long as y \u003c\u003d b.\n\nI\u0027ve updated the commit messages, feel free to reopen if it is still confusing.",
